@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "koroneiki"

Feature: Koroneiki Customer Contact and Product Purchase API Permissioning
	Testing Koroneiki Customer Contact and Product Purchase API Permissioning functionality.

Teardown:
	* I tear down the product purchases on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the following products
	| Liferay Digital Experience Platform |
	* I tear down the products on koroneiki with the following names
	| Liferay Digital Experience Platform |
	* I tear down the contacts on koroneiki with the following email addresses
	| koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	* I tear down the accounts on koroneiki with the following names
	| Koroneiki Automotive |

Scenario: View product purchase via account contact attempt
	Koroneiki product purchases created via API should not be viewable under account contact via API for non permissioned users.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                              |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                         |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                 |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                         |
	| Region                | United States                        |
	| Status                | Approved                             |
	| Tier                  | Regular                              |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com          |
	And I create a contact on koroneiki with the following values
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Language      | English                                  |
	| Last Name     | Contact1                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	And I assign customer contacts with the following email addresses to the account "Koroneiki Automotive"
	| koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	And I create a product with the following values
	| Name | Liferay Digital Experience Platform | |
	And I generate static start and end dates
	And I create a product purchase for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on koroneiki with the following values
	| End Date                | ${staticEndDate}         |                |
	| Original End Date       | ${staticOriginalEndDate} |                |
	| Perpetual               | true                     |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1          | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2          | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3          | propertyValue3 |
	| Quantity                | 1                        |                |
	| Start Date              | ${staticStartDate}       |                |
	| Status                  | Approved                 |                |
	Then I should be able to view a product purchase on koroneiki for a contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" with the following values
	| Perpetual               | true            |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1 | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2 | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3 | propertyValue3 |
	| Quantity                | 1               |                |
	| Status                  | Approved        |                |
	And I should not be able to view a product purchase on koroneiki for a contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" as a non permissioned user

Scenario: View product purchase via account contact okta id attempt
	Koroneiki product purchases created via API should not be viewable under account contact okta id via API for non permissioned users.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                              |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                         |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                 |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                         |
	| Region                | United States                        |
	| Status                | Approved                             |
	| Tier                  | Regular                              |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com          |
	And I create a contact on koroneiki with the following values
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Language      | English                                  |
	| Last Name     | Contact1                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	And I assign customer contacts with the following email addresses to the account "Koroneiki Automotive"
	| koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	And I create a product with the following values
	| Name | Liferay Digital Experience Platform | |
	And I generate static start and end dates
	And I create a product purchase for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on koroneiki with the following values
	| End Date                | ${staticEndDate}         |                |
	| Original End Date       | ${staticOriginalEndDate} |                |
	| Perpetual               | true                     |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1          | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2          | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3          | propertyValue3 |
	| Quantity                | 1                        |                |
	| Start Date              | ${staticStartDate}       |                |
	| Status                  | Approved                 |                |
	Then I should be able to view a product purchase on koroneiki for a contact with the okta ID "koroneikicontact1" on the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" with the following values
	| Perpetual               | true            |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1 | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2 | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3 | propertyValue3 |
	| Quantity                | 1               |                |
	| Status                  | Approved        |                |
	And I should not be able to view a product purchase on koroneiki for a contact with the okta ID "koroneikicontact1" on the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" as a non permissioned user